{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4387393cf29d86673a8cabcd9034093b5651c73f5ae1d563f6152cd84f23f142","ja":"えっ、バレンタインのお返し？　ありがと～☆\n杏奈の心にビビッときたよっ！","zh":"咦，情人节的回礼？谢谢啦～☆\n直击杏奈的心灵了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"081ee50d823f611456de3c08f1de350738a34fef2cc99c50c39a6ee8ac2ed31f","ja":"あなたのプレゼントで杏奈、\nとっても元気になれたみたい♪","zh":"收到你的礼物，杏奈\n好像变得非常有精神了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6255753d09a8660edfefbf6a27d629fa86011855d84971e06f50d40560f77b91","ja":"お返し……やった～！　茜ちゃんからのお返しも\n期待していいからね☆　あれ？　これだとキリがない？","zh":"回礼……太好啦～！也可以期待\n小茜的回礼哦☆咦？这样不就没完没了了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d39e21ed249e2ceefc34b3edec72c4c5fa6efc2a651106aa8b8b000f2d62d27e","ja":"ま、それもアリだよね☆\n茜ちゃんの愛、たくさん受け取ってね♪","zh":"嘛，这样也挺不错的对吧☆\n要好好收下小茜满满的爱哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e134c62cd2caea76f8f349ff9755bba6d2c9d9202d436360df6126d513f008db","ja":"お返しありがとう！\nあなたの気持ち、すっごく嬉しいよ！","zh":"谢谢你的回礼！\n能收到你的这份心意，我真的太高兴了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"dde58ba61799ae5dcac98e50d09f2df34a16e2e415fb57ca14e07aa82f272575","ja":"もったいなくて、なかなか食べられないかも。\nしばらく部屋に飾っておこうかな……ふふっ。なんて♪","zh":"太舍不得了，感觉都舍不得吃了呢。\n要不要先在房间里摆上一阵子呢……呵呵。开玩笑的♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"99e5a43998a8a6903e649ea766331dafff4a0b1ac79829539d5ff509cfb92cc6","ja":"わっ、お返しもらえるなんて思ってなかったよ！\nでもやっぱり嬉しいなっ！","zh":"哇，没想到还能收到回礼！\n不过果然还是好开心呀！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"999bb4af7bcb6300f57493237d0d65c9dc16611da6f79e22e9f4d764f719a2bc","ja":"めっちゃおいしそうなお菓子じゃん♪\nねえ……一緒に食べよ？","zh":"看起来超好吃的小点心耶♪\n呐……要不要一起吃？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d8cc5b73210feda197dcb274d084371de5cc0ca0bcf73ec8d783e8c39dee0473","ja":"お返しくれるの？　ありがとう～～～！\nなにかな、なにかな～？","zh":"要给我回礼吗？谢谢你～～～！\n会是什么呢，会是什么呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"f55203ff375a0fcbff65694c52b2653afb5b65ba707201ebcaa867c4488eb960","ja":"あっ、私の大好きなお菓子だ！\nすっごく幸せ～～～！","zh":"啊，是我最喜欢的点心！\n超级幸福～～～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"ae4b741ec0d043a148d19d3e220ff4bef8a13ba07f91b0fdbbcbbe5c8e325b51","ja":"あなたのおかげで最高のホワイトデーになったよっ！\n本当に……ありがとうっ♪","zh":"多亏了你，我度过了一个最棒的白色情人节！\n真的很……谢谢你♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"2b2f968427403d370e57f0b9859f19187ad5418870bef374ecb3915f6f9df46c","ja":"そして撮影後……","zh":"然后，拍摄结束后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"635bfb153d3ea1710cb60565efb3372621fee45fc95bfadd0cd07c420d1906f1","ja":"製菓会社さん、満足してくれたみたい！　ふふ♪\n●●●●プロデューサー効果、バッチリだったね！","zh":"糖果公司那边好像很满意呢！呵呵♪\n●●●●制作人的效果，非常显著呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"39f757ceb47ece2e1d0d6fe7ae7f0451feb923d0ddccdc8a05375d2474a4f484","ja":"それでね、CM頑張ってくれたお礼に、\nお土産用のチョコをどうぞ、だって。","zh":"然后呢，对方说为了感谢我们努力拍广告，\n特地送了当伴手礼的巧克力哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"73abc45fac43590aaf58bbd871af1d20326a00f9047eae84fe2d592b66620ebb","ja":"わあ～～～！　これってホワイトデー用の？\n……全部、茜ちゃんたちに！？","zh":"哇啊～～～！　这些是给白色情人节准备的吗？\n……全部都是给小茜她们的吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1007.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"f858ddb261031a7c960edc86246bbb16d4c61fee7fc3eb7d511d52807a88f87b","ja":"お返しのチョコって最高だねっ！\nいっただきまーす！","zh":"回礼的巧克力最棒了！\n我开动啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
